# Windsurf Rules — BroxBhai

Read first: `AGENTS.md`, then `docs/PROJECT_CONTEXT.md`, `docs/CODING_CONVENTIONS.md`, `docs/AI_CODING_GUIDE.md`.

Do:
- Edit source files (not `public_html/assets/**/dist/**`), then build.
- Keep controllers thin, move DB logic to Models.
- Use Twig templates for rendering; avoid embedding complex PHP in views.
- Add CSRF + auth checks consistently.

Don’t:
- Commit secrets or paste real tokens/keys into code.
- Introduce new frameworks or large refactors without request.

